    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📌 Step 1: Mock Lead Ingestion\nInjects 8 diverse test leads simulating noisy signup forms:\n- Missing fullNames / blank strings\n- Missing emails\n- Inconsistent casing & whitespace\n- International & symbol-laden phone numbers\n- Exact duplicate entries (Sarah Connor & Anna Lee)",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "8470ee64-cb4e-4f05-8321-72944b79b691",
      "name": "Sticky_Ingestion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🛡️ Step 2: Required Field Validation\nVerifies presence of both `fullName` and `email`:\n- Valid leads ➔ Cleansing Path (True)\n- Incomplete leads ➔ `Rejected_Missing_Fields` (False)\nPrevents workflow termination on invalid data.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "18f9dfd7-849a-4cce-9a3b-cbb1bdfaeae7",
      "name": "Sticky_Validation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🧹 Step 3: Sanitization & Normalization\n- **Name:** Trim & Title Case normalization\n- **Email:** Lowercase & whitespace stripped\n- **Phone:** Regex `replace(/[^0-9]/g, '')` strips symbols, parentheses, and dashes.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "7faef9f1-325d-4f10-96f7-c20e171b3e8e",
      "name": "Sticky_Sanitization",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        980,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔍 Step 4: Intelligent Deduplication\nCompares against `cleanedEmail` within the active batch.\n- Duplicate #4 (Sarah Connor) is discarded.\n- Duplicate #7 (Anna Lee) is discarded.\nOnly first unique occurrences proceed downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "673f8e5b-3810-449e-97c7-5ea0cbda413e",
      "name": "Sticky_Deduplication",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1240,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎯 Step 5: CRM-Ready Output Synthesis\n- Structures uniform lead object\n- Retains `originalEmail` via cross-node lookup `$('Mock_Leads')`\n- Sets status to `PROCESSED_ACTIVE_LEAD`\n- Marks `crmSyncReady: true`",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "8c5da88b-6663-4a00-ab83-659f7b49463c",
      "name": "Sticky_Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1500,
        -40
      ]
    }
